 "examine": [
  {
   "x": 27,
   "y": 36,
   "needs": "q_arc_scotland_7",
   "flag": "q_arc_scotland_8",
   "text": [
    "A lone chimney gable stands in the heather with nothing left around it. Strathnaver was cleared in 1814, and a thousand glens in the north look like this. The village names live on only in the maps and in the songs.",
    "Seonag said some places are green where the houses stood. This is the sort of place she meant. You stand a while, and no one says anything."
   ]
  }
 ]
